{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48790","headline":"登绵州富乐山别李道士䇿 · 薛曜","name":"登绵州富乐山别李道士䇿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠阙崑山远，银宫涨海悬。\n送君从此路，城郭几千年。\n云雾含丹景，桑麻覆细田。\n笙歌未尽曲，风驭独泠然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}